{"id":"n15686-1-6","stage":4,"title":"마누라 · 老婆","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15686-1-6-1","ko":"요즘 자꾸 마누라의 눈치를 보게 돼.","zh":"最近老得看老婆的脸色。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자꾸","meaning":"一直，总是","explanation":"자꾸：一直，总是","readings":[{"term":"자꾸","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70796","senseId":"1","lemma":"자꾸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마누라의","meaning":"老婆","explanation":"마누라：老婆；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"마누라","audio":"/audio/1d1ba84c34182c62a75c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15686","senseId":"1","lemma":"마누라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈치를","meaning":"眼力，眼力见儿","explanation":"눈치：眼力，眼力见儿；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈치","audio":"/audio/e2d6245630ee85fa9b86.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41644","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보게","meaning":"看，看待","explanation":"보다：看，看待；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"4","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"d28ff63a0382ce4f","term":"자꾸","zh":"一直，总是","audio":"/audio/d28ff63a0382ce4fce6d.mp3","entryId":"70796","definition":"多次连续地。","pronunciation":["자꾸"]},{"id":"1d1ba84c34182c62","term":"마누라","zh":"老婆","audio":"/audio/1d1ba84c34182c62a75c.mp3","entryId":"15686","definition":"(亲近)中年以上的妻子。","pronunciation":["마누라"]},{"id":"e2d6245630ee85fa","term":"눈치","zh":"眼力，眼力见儿","audio":"/audio/e2d6245630ee85fa9b86.mp3","entryId":"41644","definition":"即使对方不说也能理解或知道对方的心情或事情状况的能力。","pronunciation":["눈치"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，看待","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"认识并判断事件或情况。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fba39a88947d4e1f6808.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15686-1-6-2","ko":"무슨 잘못한 거 있어?","zh":"你做什么亏心事了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘못한","meaning":"做错，做得不好","explanation":"잘못하다：做错，做得不好；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"c088e8817916a36c","term":"잘못하다","zh":"做错，做得不好","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3","entryId":"69936","definition":"做得有错或不对。","pronunciation":["잘모타다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf0f611bb7225f188963.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15686","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":127,"sequenceScore":2.3367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近老得看老婆的脸色。","你做什么亏心事了？","粥好像煮得有点稠了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近老得看老婆的脸色。","你做什么亏心事了？","粥好像煮得有点稠了？"],"answer":1}]}
